  "source": "timing.mimo.json:phonebook-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "在浏览器里输入 example 点 com，按下回车。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.592
   },
   {
    "text": "可网络上的机器只认 IP 地址，就像打电话只认号码。",
    "start": 3.872,
    "dur": 5.071
   }
  ]
 },
 "phonebook-2": {
  "audioSec": 11.333,
  "audioFrames": 340,
  "duration": 400,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 277,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:phonebook-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "人记得住名字，记不住一串数字，所以需要一本电话簿，把名字翻译成号码。",
    "start": -0.01,
    "dur": 7.351
   },
   {
    "text": "帮你查这本电话簿的系统，就叫 DNS。",
    "start": 7.621,
    "dur": 3.719
   }
  ]
 },
 "cache-1": {
  "audioSec": 11.933,
  "audioFrames": 358,
  "duration": 366,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:cache-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "查号码之前，先翻自己的小本子。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.769
   },
   {
    "text": "浏览器会先看自己最近查过的记录，再问操作系统；系统除了自己的缓存，还会看一个叫 Hosts 的本地文件。",
    "start": 3.049,
    "dur": 8.87
   }
  ]
 },
 "cache-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.333,
  "audioFrames": 130,
  "duration": 190,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 366,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:cache-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "只要在这里找到，就直接拿号码去拨，一步都不用往外走。",
    "start": -0.001,
    "dur": 4.328
   }
  ]
 },
 "resolver-1": {
  "audioSec": 12.433,
  "audioFrames": 373,
  "duration": 382,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:resolver-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "小本子里没有，就打给查号台，也就是递归解析器。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.005
   },
   {
    "text": "它通常由运营商提供，也可以换成 一点一点一点一、八点八点八点八 这样的公共 DNS。",
    "start": 4.285,
    "dur": 8.155
   }
  ]
 },
 "resolver-2": {
  "audioSec": 6.433,
  "audioFrames": 193,
  "duration": 253,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 382,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:resolver-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你只问一句：example 点 com 的号码是多少？",
    "start": -0.013,
    "dur": 3.572
   },
   {
    "text": "剩下的路，都由它替你去跑。",
    "start": 3.839,
    "dur": 2.579
   }
  ]
 },
 "iterative-1a": {
  "audioSec": 9.0,
  "audioFrames": 270,
  "duration": 278,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:iterative-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "查号台手里也没有，就从最顶层问起。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.067
   },
   {
    "text": "它先问根服务器，根服务器不知道答案，只告诉它 点 com 归谁管。",
    "start": 3.347,
    "dur": 5.637
   }
  ]
 },
 "iterative-1b": {
  "audioSec": 9.467,
  "audioFrames": 284,
  "duration": 292,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 278,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:iterative-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "再去问 点 com 的服务器，它说 example 点 com 由哪几台权威服务器负责。",
    "start": -0.003,
    "dur": 5.555
   },
   {
    "text": "最后问到权威服务器，才拿到真正的号码。",
    "start": 5.832,
    "dur": 3.633
   }
  ]
 },
 "iterative-2": {
  "audioSec": 6.133,
  "audioFrames": 184,
  "duration": 244,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 570,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:iterative-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "根服务器只有 13 个名字，但每个名字背后，都是分布在全世界的许多台机器。",
    "start": 0.012,
    "dur": 6.132
   }
  ]
 },
 "ttl-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.1,
  "audioFrames": 213,
  "duration": 222,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:ttl-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "查到的号码会一路记下来：查号台记一份，系统和浏览器也各记一份，下次就不用再跑一趟。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.107
   }
  ]
 },
 "ttl-2": {
  "audioSec": 5.467,
  "audioFrames": 164,
  "duration": 173,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 222,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:ttl-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "每条记录都带着一个有效期，叫 TTL，到期就作废，得重新查。",
    "start": -0.013,
    "dur": 5.486
   }
  ]
 },
 "ttl-3": {
  "audioSec": 8.133,
  "audioFrames": 244,
  "duration": 304,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 395,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:ttl-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "所以网站改了地址，旧号码还在各处的小本子里，要等它们陆续过期，新地址才会处处生效。",
    "start": -0.014,
    "dur": 8.157
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 10.133,
  "audioFrames": 304,
  "duration": 312,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:recap-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "串起来看：先翻自己的小本子，没有就打给查号台，查号台从根服务器问到 点 com，再问到权威服务器，拿到号码，顺手记下来。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 10.128
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-2": {
  "audioSec": 6.133,
  "audioFrames": 184,
  "duration": 244,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 312,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "timing.mimo.json:recap-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "拿到 IP 地址之后，浏览器才能建立连接、发出请求，也就是第一期讲的那一步。",
    "start": 0.008,
    "dur": 6.123
   }
  ]
 }
}